💸 Payment Method & Platform Analysis (New)
Five questions I answered using the new columns:
1️⃣ Customers and revenue for each payment method
2️⃣ Which platform gets the most orders & units, and its share of revenue
3️⃣ Average order value for each platform + payment method combo (top 3)
4️⃣ Best-selling genre on each platform
5️⃣ Platform revenue growth from 2023 to 2024
Quick results:
✔️ Payment methods by revenue: Cash $41,673.45 (27.4%), Offline $39,480.75 (25.9%), Online $37,490.61 (24.6%), Card $33,635.00 (22.1%)
✔️ Platforms by revenue: Amazon $33,571.43, Myntra $32,412.70, Meesho $29,682.64, Flipkart $29,224.58, Ajio $27,388.46
✔️ Amazon is the top platform with 214 orders and 1,197 units (22.0% of revenue)
✔️ Highest average order value: Flipkart + Cash at $176.89
✔️ Top genre per platform: Amazon – Science Fiction (232 units); Flipkart – Mystery (186 units); Meesho – Fantasy (225 units); Myntra – Science Fiction (209 units); Ajio – Romance (192 units)
