🧩 How to Run This Project
1.	Create a database in MySQL
2.	Run the table creation script (Books, Customers, Orders)
3.	Import Books.csv, Customers.csv, Orders.csv (in this order, so the foreign keys work)
4.	Convert Order_Date while importing, since the CSV has dd-mm-yyyy: STR_TO_DATE(Order_Date, '%d-%m-%Y')
5.	Execute Queries for analysis
This project was executed using MySQL Workbench & MySQL.
